// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>

/ {
    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        equal {
            bindings = <&kp EQUAL>;
            key-positions = <16 17>;
            timeout-ms = <75>;
            layers = <1>;
        };

        tilde {
            bindings = <&kp TILDE>;
            key-positions = <13 12>;
            timeout-ms = <75>;
            layers = <1>;
        };
    };

    behaviors {
        exqm: exqm {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "EXQM";
            bindings = <&kp EXCL>, <&kp QMARK>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        cose: cose {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "COSE";
            bindings = <&kp COMMA>, <&kp SEMI>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        doco: doco {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "DOCO";
            bindings = <&kp DOT>, <&kp COLON>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        sqgr: sqgr {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            label = "SQGR";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp SQT>, <&kp GRAVE>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base {
            bindings = <
           &kp Q  &kp W  &kp E      &kp R  &kp T        &kp Y     &kp U  &kp I      &kp O  &kp P
           &kp A  &kp S  &kp D      &kp F  &kp G        &kp H     &kp J  &kp K      &kp L  &sqgr
&kp LSHFT  &kp Z  &kp X  &kp C      &kp V  &kp B        &kp N     &kp M  &cose      &doco  &exqm  &kp RSHFT
                         &kp LCTRL  &mo 1  &kp SPACE    &kp LALT  &mo 2  &kp LMETA
            >;
        };

        num_sym {
            bindings = <
        &kp N1    &kp N2    &kp N3    &kp N4    &kp N5       &kp N6     &kp N7    &kp N8    &kp N9     &kp N0
        &kp PIPE  &kp AT    &kp HASH  &kp DLLR  &kp PRCNT    &kp CARET  &kp AMPS  &kp STAR  &kp MINUS  &kp PLUS
&trans  &kp BSLH  &kp LPAR  &kp RPAR  &kp LBKT  &kp RBKT     &kp LBRC   &kp RBRC  &kp LT    &kp GT     &kp FSLH  &trans
                            &trans    &trans    &kp UNDER    &trans     &trans    &trans
            >;
        };

        nav {
            bindings = <
        &kp ESC    &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE    &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp BSPC
        &kp TAB    &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE    &kp LEFT   &kp DOWN   &kp UP     &kp RIGHT  &kp RET
&trans  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE    &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &kp SPACE  &trans
                              &trans     &trans     &trans       &trans     &trans     &trans
            >;
        };

        device {
            bindings = <
       &none       &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_DEC  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_INC  &none             &none    &bt BT_SEL 0  &bt BT_SEL 1  &bt BT_SEL 2  &bt BT_SEL 3  &bt BT_SEL 4
       &kp K_MUTE  &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN     &kp C_VOLUME_UP       &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE  &none    &none         &none         &none         &none         &none
&none  &none       &none                 &none                 &none             &none    &none         &none         &none         &none         &none         &bt BT_CLR
                                         &none                 &none             &none    &none         &none         &none
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers {
        compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers";

        device {
            if-layers = <3 2>;
            then-layer = <4>;
        };
    };
};
